; Fail fast when the running Node violates engines.node (^24.15.0 — jsdom 30's
; floor on the Node 24 LTS line). This makes the engine pin authoritative for
; every local-dev path, not just nvm: a bare `.nvmrc` of `24` can leave `nvm use`
; sitting on an already-installed 24.0–24.14, so this guard blocks `npm ci` /
; `npm install` on any Node below the floor instead of silently installing and
; testing under an engine-mismatched runtime.
; See docs/decisions/ADR-067-dependency-upgrade-policy.md § 6c.
engine-strict=true
